Knock-out of Caspase-8 alters cellular behaviors
To further explore the roles of Caspase-8 expression in the malignant behavior of cervical cancer cells that might contribute to poor patient prognosis, we used the CRISPR/Cas9 system to generate
CASP8-/-
HeLa and SiHa cells (Fig.
2
