To investigate whether the correlation between Caspase-8 expression and pCDK9 levels in cervical cancer patients also extended to phospho-RNAPII levels, we next knocked-down Caspase-8 expression in primary cells derived from a cervical tumor. Immunoblotting revealed enhanced pCDK9 and phospho-RNAPII in the siCasp8-treated cells compared to siCtrl transfected cells (Fig.
